# One line ending in the repository, whatever the checkout platform.
#
# The repository grew up mixed - some files CRLF, some LF - and an editor or a
# script touching a CRLF file rewrote it whole, turning a two-line change into
# an eight-hundred-line diff. Normalizing costs one large commit and saves that
# noise on every commit after it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are left alone: a byte in an image is not a line ending.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
